================================================================================
Pi (packages/mcp)
https://github.com/earendil-works/pi
Release v1.3.0, revision 71023aec1546d6d677a65669c5665c0927ce0dd0.
Ported: the JSON-RPC message shapes and checks of src/protocol/jsonrpc.ts, the
protocol versions and initialize, tool, and tool-result shapes of
src/protocol/types.ts and src/protocol/content.ts, the resource, resource
template, and resource-contents shapes and their checks of
src/protocol/types.ts and src/client.ts (isResource, isResourceTemplate,
toResource, toResourceTemplate, validateListPage, and
validateReadResourceResult), the request correlation,
initialization, tool listing and calling, the resource listings,
resources/read, and the method-not-found rule for
resources/templates/list (withoutTemplates), cancellation, and close
behavior of src/client.ts, the transport contract of src/transports/transport.ts, and the
newline-delimited framing and the process lifecycle of
src/transports/stdio.ts (process-tree ownership, the stdin-close, SIGTERM, and
SIGKILL shutdown sequence, and the bounded standard error tail), and the
Streamable HTTP transport of src/transports/streamable-http.ts (its SSE
decoder, POST, GET stream, session, protocol-version, resumption,
reconnection, and close behavior, without the auth provider), with cases of
test/client.test.ts, test/stdio.test.ts, and test/streamable-http.test.ts and
the behavior of test/fixtures/stdio-server.mjs and stubborn-server.mjs.
Not ported: the OAuth client and the auth provider (src/oauth/,
src/auth-provider.ts; Pi adapted src/oauth/ from the MIT-licensed Model
Context Protocol TypeScript SDK, whose notice Pi keeps under
packages/mcp/LICENSES/), cross-spawn's Windows command resolution, the
process-exit hook, resource subscriptions, progress, and roots.
